{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Boy is a precision 2D platformer game inspired by the rich history of old-school gaming.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b959e100b4c3fd5b06a4694d6645e32f.poster.avif?t=1759589809\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b959e100b4c3fd5b06a4694d6645e32f.webm?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b959e100b4c3fd5b06a4694d6645e32f.mp4?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Jake's adventure to escape the prison controlled by Titan Octano and return to his village.<br><br>Game Features: <br><br>- Precise and responsive controls. <br>- Various traps and enemies in each new stage. <br>- Battles against Titan Octano. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b72cff21fda6cf00a50b4c665fe27f01.poster.avif?t=1759589809\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b72cff21fda6cf00a50b4c665fe27f01.webm?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b72cff21fda6cf00a50b4c665fe27f01.mp4?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60 amazing levels across 3 difficulty levels.<br>Choose a difficulty and come help Jake get out of this mess!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/91cf74a4ca6f0900b0895f433cda203e.poster.avif?t=1759589809\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/91cf74a4ca6f0900b0895f433cda203e.webm?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/91cf74a4ca6f0900b0895f433cda203e.mp4?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Game History: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The screen dims as you find yourself in a dark and gloomy cell. The sound of chains echoes through the cold walls as you rise, confused and disoriented. You are a boy named Jake, who lives in an isolated village, where the elders tell tales of the Prison Legend.<br><br>The prison, known as the 'Shadow Fortress,' is an imposing structure that rises like a monument to the cruelty of Titan Octano. Its existence is a legend in the village, but for you, Jake, it has become a terrible reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to escape from this prison, Jake begins his journey to freedom. Guided by a mixture of courage and despair, he faces a series of challenges within the shadowy walls of the prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jake progresses through the labyrinthine corridors and guarded halls, he gradually learns to navigate the dangers of the prison, avoiding Titan Octano's knights, disabling security systems, and overcoming seemingly insurmountable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as Jake delves deeper into the prison, he uncovers dark secrets about Titan Octano and his sinister agenda. He learns that the Titan Octano legend was true and could not be underestimated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each challenge overcome, Jake becomes more determined than ever to defeat Titan Octano and escape from the prison. He turns his fear into triumph, using his skills and resolve to overcome every obstacle in his path.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Good Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/2af7828996e5ece4d58ecb851512b46545e3c467.jpg"},{"name":"Sharp Saws","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/b57564a63a85635131b77af7c078489d7a80f5fe.jpg"},{"name":"Overcoming Challenges","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/946bc391dddb13e7379e09e585d1b1ac20471425.jpg"},{"name":"Run","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/09485df0bf0222c3a020e5e45eba0bcfa4cfc201.jpg"},{"name":"Almost There","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/433d0aef6c0d52929ccb043a22e0aa447da05154.jpg"},{"name":"Overcome","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/5adecb7bdc5f89d554ed9b1a3d3c26b990c1d8cc.jpg"},{"name":"Accumulating","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/0987e98dcc537eaa240ab399560fed4dad4472c1.jpg"},{"name":"Memories","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/6f0f7e1aeec2f6758a688ff9e9ac053357012ce2.jpg"},{"name":"Surpassing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/1a7da3e8fb7fc76b157a23a9c8f1b825fc6e249e.jpg"},{"name":"Extraordinary Score","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2958120/bdbf4bd5dea3635a640032c6d054f19cda2fe6b0.jpg"}],"total":30},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2958120?t=1759589809","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2958120?t=1759589809","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759589809","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759589809","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3236400,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prison Boy is a precision 2D platformer game inspired by the rich history of old-school gaming.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b959e100b4c3fd5b06a4694d6645e32f.poster.avif?t=1759589809\" width=800 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b959e100b4c3fd5b06a4694d6645e32f.webm?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b959e100b4c3fd5b06a4694d6645e32f.mp4?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Jake's adventure to escape the prison controlled by Titan Octano and return to his village.<br><br>Game Features: <br><br>- Precise and responsive controls. <br>- Various traps and enemies in each new stage. <br>- Battles against Titan Octano. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b72cff21fda6cf00a50b4c665fe27f01.poster.avif?t=1759589809\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b72cff21fda6cf00a50b4c665fe27f01.webm?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/b72cff21fda6cf00a50b4c665fe27f01.mp4?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 60 amazing levels across 3 difficulty levels.<br>Choose a difficulty and come help Jake get out of this mess!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/91cf74a4ca6f0900b0895f433cda203e.poster.avif?t=1759589809\" width=616 height=154 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/91cf74a4ca6f0900b0895f433cda203e.webm?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/extras/91cf74a4ca6f0900b0895f433cda203e.mp4?t=1759589809\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <br>Game History: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The screen dims as you find yourself in a dark and gloomy cell. The sound of chains echoes through the cold walls as you rise, confused and disoriented. You are a boy named Jake, who lives in an isolated village, where the elders tell tales of the Prison Legend.<br><br>The prison, known as the 'Shadow Fortress,' is an imposing structure that rises like a monument to the cruelty of Titan Octano. Its existence is a legend in the village, but for you, Jake, it has become a terrible reality. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Determined to escape from this prison, Jake begins his journey to freedom. Guided by a mixture of courage and despair, he faces a series of challenges within the shadowy walls of the prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Jake progresses through the labyrinthine corridors and guarded halls, he gradually learns to navigate the dangers of the prison, avoiding Titan Octano's knights, disabling security systems, and overcoming seemingly insurmountable obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as Jake delves deeper into the prison, he uncovers dark secrets about Titan Octano and his sinister agenda. He learns that the Titan Octano legend was true and could not be underestimated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each challenge overcome, Jake becomes more determined than ever to defeat Titan Octano and escape from the prison. He turns his fear into triumph, using his skills and resolve to overcome every obstacle in his path.</p>","developers":["Milton Rodrigues Junior"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2958120/49262ff0dda7aa2d518747f61da23a2d4bac12df/header.jpg?t=1759589809","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2958120/1778752861/766144d1888b611c0232aa51d1f3fac814b5340f/1750953189/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749464074","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2958120/1778752861/766144d1888b611c0232aa51d1f3fac814b5340f/1750953189/dash_h264.mpd?t=1749464074","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2958120/1778752861/766144d1888b611c0232aa51d1f3fac814b5340f/1750953189/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749464074","id":257154000,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154000/movie480.mp4?t=1749464074","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154000/movie_max.mp4?t=1749464074"},"name":"Trailer Launch","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257154000/1db68572b52b0a04c6be0eaaf73b274084af365d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749464074","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154000/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749464074","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257154000/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1749464074"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2958120/691722/08284c2535c800eb387